  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to Confidence Building in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support confidence-building activities in Bosnia and Herzegovina (BiH), Montenegro, North Macedonia, Serbia , and Kosovo*. The project will step up the provision of expertise and support to better equip judicial and law enforcement authorities in handling war crimes cases at the domestic level, improve the conditions for regional cooperation in processing these cases, enhance the delivery of support services to victims and witnesses and strengthen the capacity of relevant actor</narrative>
  </description>
